ChorusDraft Linux Elixir version (unreleased)
Modification notice — September 5, 2026

This testing build is an Elixir implementation of ChorusDraft, based on the
feature set and safeguards in ChorusDraft 0.51.1. One application supports both
Bluesky and Mastodon through platform-specific command modes and configuration
directories.

The implementation includes interactive review for AI drafts, privacy
exclusions, do-not-contact controls, interaction limits, credential-safe errors,
ambiguous-publication handling, optional Bluesky Jetstream, read-only state
import, and a Linux package containing both modes plus corresponding source.

